 "notes": {
  "forAnalyst": "Account and company self-service for a signed-in shopper: their profile, their addresses, their colleagues and who may do what.",
  "forArchitect": "Four schema builders over Customer, with four optional dependencies — the most optional of any X module, which is what lets a customer-and-company Cell stand on its own. B2B organisation structure is the part that makes it more than a profile editor.",
  "forDeveloper": "Authorisation is the work: every query is scoped to the caller and their organisation role. Extend the requirements, not the resolver, when adding a field only an administrator should see.",
  "owns": [],
  "reachForItWhen": [
   "A storefront, app or agent needs data shaped for one round trip",
   "You are extending an existing query or mutation rather than adding an endpoint",
   "The host should serve only this capability's API surface"
  ],
  "doNotReachForItWhen": [
   "Back-office CRUD — that is the module's REST controller",
   "You need a table: these modules own no schema, they compose other modules' services",
   "Bulk writes: a mutation per row is slower than the owning module's import path"
  ]
